#!/usr/bin/env bash

lord --verbose << "EOF"
Whatever the final cantillation mark or niqqud or whatever the hell it is in this hebrew isn't rendering. Delete them all in 01-genesis/49.tex

\Verse{6}
{
	\hProto{בְּסֹדָם אַל תָּבֹא נַפְשִׁי בִּקְהָלָם אַל תֵּחַד כְּבֹדִי כִּי בְאַפָּם הָרְגוּ אִישׁ וּבִרְצֹנָם עִקְּרוּ שׁוֹר׃}
}
{
	\eProto{
		Let my soul not come in their council; let my glory not be
		united in their society. For in their anger they killed a
		man, and by their will they crippled an ox.
	}
}
{
}

EOF
